{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0156","name":"雍齿","evidence":["wudi-q-p051"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-p051-wudi-p0156","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p051"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-p051","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-6aff33c5f292e9e37d04","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“袁绍宿与故太尉杨彪、大长秋梁绍、少府孔融有隙，欲使公以他过诛之。公曰：‘当今天下土崩瓦解，雄豪并起；辅相君长，人怀怏怏，各有自为之心：此上下相疑之秋也。虽以无嫌待之，犹惧未信；如有所除，则谁不自危？且夫起布衣，在尘垢之间，为庸人之所陵陷，可胜怨乎！高祖赦雍齿之仇而群情以安，如何忘之？’绍以为公外托公义，内实离异，深怀怨望。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-cdd3bfb40221ff390ede","start":0,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
